# Responsive Card Layout for shadcn/ui Tables

All tables in the application that use `@/components/ui/table` (`shadcn/ui`) MUST render a responsive Card per record on mobile, tablet, and medium-resolution screens (`(max-width: 1279px)`):

1. Use `useIsCompactTableViewport()` from `@/hooks/useResponsiveTable` to detect mobile, tablet, and medium viewports (`< 1280px`).
2. When `isCompactViewport` is `true`, render `<ResponsiveTableCards>` and `<ResponsiveTableCard>` from `@/components/ui/responsive-table` instead of `<Table>`:
   - Include the record's primary identifier and badges in `<ResponsiveTableCardHeader>`.
   - Include all columns and row values in `<ResponsiveTableCardFields>` (do not hide data columns on mobile/tablet/medium screens).
   - Include the complete action button group (`botonera`) in `<ResponsiveTableCardActions>`.
3. Render only the active view (`<ResponsiveTableCards>` when compact, `<Table>` on `>= 1280px` or print) so interactive controls and accessibility roles are not duplicated in the DOM.
